presence/absence using at least two independent tools when the first reports negative.\",\n    \"Verify laterality by checking image orientation markers (e.g., 'L' or 'R') and matching with tool-reported coordinates.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":468,"total_tokens":841,"completion_tokens":373,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":468},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":373}}}